  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Goma- Livelihood Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will assist 1000 households who are returning to their villages after a long time of war. To this end, the project will assist in the recovery of agro-pastoral activities by distributing seeds and farm tools to three villages in RUTSHURU district. The project will also popularize the practice of ecological agriculture, and will rehabilitate three schools in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
